ere sunlight is limited and planting becomes a tactical challenge!\n- Survive in our brand new hardcore mode, Rest In Peace, where one mistake could send you right back to the beginning\n- Team up with a friend in local co-op mode to defend the backyard together\n- Battle head-to-head in local PvP mode by taking control of the Zombies\n\nConditions & restrictions apply. See ea.com/legal/legal-disclosures for details.\n\n©2025 Electronic Arts Inc. Electronic Arts, PopCap and Plants vs. Zombies are trademarks of Electronic Arts Inc.","SkuTitle":"Plants vs. Zombies™: Replanted - PC","SkuButtonTitle":"","DeliveryDateOverlay":null,"SkuDisplayRank":[],"TextResources":null,"Images":[],"LegalText":{"AdditionalLicenseTerms":"","Copyright":"","CopyrightUri":"","PrivacyPolicy":"","PrivacyPolicyUri":"https://www.ea.com/legal","Tou":"","TouUri":""},"Language":"en","Markets":["US","DZ","AR","AU","AT","BH","BD","BE","BR","BG","CA","CL","CN","CO","CR","HR","CY","CZ","DK","EG","EE","FI","FR","DE","GR","GT","HK","HU","IS","IN","ID","IQ","IE","IL","IT","JP","JO","KZ","KE","KW","LV","LB","LI","LT","LU","MY","MT","MR","MX","MA","NL","NZ","NG","NO","OM","PK","PE","PH","PL","PT","QA","RO","RU","SA","RS","SG","SK","SI","ZA","KR","ES","SE","CH","TW","TH","TT","TN","TR","UA","AE","GB","VN","YE","LY","LK","UY","VE","AF","AX","AL","AS","AO","AI","AQ","AG","AM","AW","BO","BQ","BA","BW","BV","IO","BN","BF","BI","KH","CM","CV","KY","CF","TD","TL","DJ","DM","DO","EC","SV","GQ","ER","ET","FK","FO","FJ","GF","PF","TF","GA","GM","GE","GH","GI","GL","GD","GP","GU","GG","GN","GW","GY","HT","HM","HN","AZ","BS","BB","BY","BZ","BJ","BM","BT","KM","CG","CD","CK","CX","CC","CI","CW","JM","SJ","JE","KI","KG","LA","LS","LR","MO","MK","MG","MW","IM","MH","MQ","MU","YT","FM","MD","MN","MS","MZ","MM","NA","NR","NP","MV","ML","NC","NI","NE","NU","NF","PW","PS","PA","PG","PY","RE","RW","BL","MF","WS","ST","SN","MP","PN","SX","SB","SO","SC","SL","GS","SH","KN","LC","PM","VC","TJ","TZ","TG","TK","TO","TM","TC","TV",